        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Baldwin ARC-RAR, Rustic Arch Lever with Arch Rose</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Arch Lever with Matching Rose has a classic design that has been a favorite amongst home owners and designers alike for many years. It has a timelessness that makes it a great choice because it seems to transform with the decor around it. The Baldwin Arch Lever will fit most predrilled doors. It has an adjustable latch for doors with 2-3/8 inch or 2-3/4 inch backsets and will fit doors 1-3/8 inches to 2-1/2 inches thick. Choose from either a dark bronze or a white bronze finish--both of which have a 25 year warranty. Available as a keyed entry, passage, privacy, or dummy function.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Traditional Wave Lever:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>2-1/8\" cross bore and 1\" edge bore for latch</li>\r\n<li>Latch Bolt: 1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Strike: square corner</li>\r\n<li>Keyed entry features the Baldwin 5-pin tumbler C keyway.</li>\r\n<li>Tested to exceed ANSI/BHMA Grade 2 Security.</li>\r\n<li>Warranty: 25 year finish warranty and a limited lifetime mechanical warranty.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Baldwin Reserve Arch Lever with Rustic Arch Rose:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Lever Length: 4-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 2-9/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Keyed Entry Projection: 2-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Rose Width: 2-11/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Rose Length: 4-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-3/8\" - 2\" standard with optional thick door kit for 2\" - 2-1/2\".</li>\r\n<li>Backset: Adjustable for 2-3/4\" or 2-3/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Latchbolt: 1/2\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Function:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Half Dummy:</b> A surfaced mounted, non-working lever. Non-locking and non-latching trim for one side of door. This inactive pull is usually used to match trim. </li>\r\n<li><b>Full Dummy:</b> Non-working levers. Non-locking and non-latching trim for both sides of door. These inactive pulls are usually used to match trim.</li>\r\n<li><b>Passage (hall or closet):</b> Latches but does not lock. The latch is activated by turning the either of the two levers.</li>\r\n<li><b>Privacy (bedroom or bathroom):</b> Latches and can be locked. Can be locked from the inside with a push-button.</li>\r\n<li><b>Keyed Entry:</b> Use when a keyed lock is needed. An ANSI/BHMA A156.2 Grade 2 security lock that is operated by a key from the exterior and a turnbutton on the lever from the interior. Complete set - 2 levers, 2 roses, 2 keys, door latch and strike plate.</li>\r\n<rb>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually. Interior roses and Half Dummy roses have exposed screws.</i>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/BAL-Rustic-Finishes.jpg?v=1704354531\" width=\"384\" height=\"176\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Baldwin Reserve Finish Options\">\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Arch Lever with Matching Rose, Baldwin ARC-RAR",
                "description": "Baldwin ARC-RAR, Arch Lever with Matching Rose - The Arch Lever with Matching Rose has a classic design that has been a favorite amongst home owners and designers alike for many years. It has a timelessness that makes it a great choice because it seems to transform with the decor around it. The Baldwin Arch Lever will fit most predrilled doors. It has an adjustable latch for doors with 2-3/8 inch or 2-3/4 inch backsets and will fit doors 1-3/4 inches to 2-1/2 inches thick. Choose from either a dark bronze or a white bronze finish--both of which have a 25 year warranty. Available as a keyed entry, passage, privacy, or dummy function.",
                "keywords": "keyed entry levers, Baldwin reserve collections, rustic levers, classic levers, traditional levers, Baldwin Reserve Wave Leversets, Baldwin ARC-RAR, Arch Lever with Matching Roses, BAL-ARC-RAR, Rustic Arch Lever with Arch Roses, Baldwin Reserve Arch Lever with Rustic Arch Roses ,Traditional Wave Levers,"
